NAME
    wmclock - digital clock WM client (Path C phase 9)

SYNOPSIS
    wmclock [SECONDS]

DESCRIPTION
    Open a 260x100 WM window that displays the current time in
    HH:MM:SS format using a 2x-scaled 8x8 font.  Polls sys_time()
    every 250 ms and re-renders the surface.

    Keyboard (only while focused — click the window first):
      SPACE    toggle between 24-hour and 12-hour mode (AM/PM)

    Exit after SECONDS (default 60) or when the WM closes the
    window.

SEE ALSO
    wmd(1), wmtype(1), wmpaint(1)
